REALROUTE 0.15
id ancestry-entangled
claim_scope defeat-route-ontology
source_ontology O1
target_ontology O2
content x
content y
source_route sx shared x COVERED
source_route sy shared y COVERED
target_route tx shared x
target_route ty shared y
map sx EXACT tx
map sy EXACT ty
coverage_witness sx tx x
coverage_witness sy ty y
authorize_coverage_authority HOLD_ROUTE_ANCESTRY_ENTANGLEMENT
authorize_coverage_equivalence YES
authorize_duplication NO
authorize_collapse NO
authorize_hidden_novel NO
authorize_ancestry_entanglement YES
authorize_path_conflict NO
END
